{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24133","headline":"罢府归旧居 · 白居易","name":"罢府归旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷乘篮入，朱门挂印回。\n腰间抛组绶，缨上拂尘埃。\n屈曲闲池沼，无非手自开。\n青苍好竹树，亦是眼看栽。\n石片擡琴匣，松枝阁酒杯。\n此生终老处，昨日却归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}